  "Start at a Level 1 Camp Outpost if your camp has no territory. East and West open first, followed by North and South. Secure connecting Outposts and Passes to reach the centre.": "如果您的营地没有领土，请从 1 级营地前哨站开始。先开东、西，再开北、南。确保连接前哨站和通行证以到达中心。",
