  "Sunday invasions and teleports": "周日入侵和传送",
  "Sunday windows may let you challenge enemy-camp targets beyond normal borders. Same-camp holdings remain protected from friendly challenges. Advanced Teleporters can enter eligible allied territory, and some events have direct travel to Guilds, Camp HQ or the Ark Core. Check the live rules before committing teleports or troops.": "周日窗口可能会让你挑战正常边界之外的敌方营地目标。同阵营的财产仍然受到保护，免受友好挑战。高级传送者可以进入符合条件的盟军领土，并且某些活动可以直接前往公会、营地总部或方舟核心。在进行传送或部队之前检查实时规则。",
