  "The client lists the first battle on Thursday at 12:00 server time, lasting one hour and repeating every seven days. Check your event screen for the live window.": "客户端列出了周四服务器时间12:00的第一场战斗，持续一小时，每7天重复一次。检查活动屏幕上的实时窗口。",
  "The client references a revised Relic Skill system and an invasion effect that can increase troop fatalities in applicable fights. Confirm which effects are active before changing Relic Skills or committing to an invasion. Exact values, costs and reset rules are unresolved.": "客户引用了修订后的遗物技能系统和入侵效果，该效果可能会增加适用战斗中的部队死亡人数。在更改遗物技能或进行入侵之前确认哪些效果处于活动状态。确切的价值、成本和重置规则尚未确定。",
  "The client uses this weekly settlement point. Newly captured Level 2 and 3 Mining Sites gain the Abundant Effect for their first two outputs. Exact rates and boost percentages are unresolved. Once you have in-game values, enter them in the": "客户使用该每周结算点。新占领的 2 级和 3 级采矿点的前两个输出获得丰富的效果。确切的比率和提升百分比尚未确定。一旦你有了游戏内的数值，请将它们输入到",
  "The first camp to reach 100% takes the site. The guide estimates roughly 30 minutes of uninterrupted control. Ownership then locks until the following day.": "第一个达到 100% 的营地占领该地盘。该指南估计不间断控制时间约为 30 分钟。然后所有权锁定到第二天。",
  "The first declaration starts a shared 60-second countdown. A camp that declares after battle opens joins immediately.": "第一个声明开始共享 60 秒倒计时。战斗开始后宣布的阵营会立即加入。",
  "The first opening is configured for Week 3, Thursday at 12:00 server time. The window lasts one hour and repeats every seven days. It runs alongside territory play. Plan a separate rally and reinforcement roster for this cross-state contest and verify event entry, capture rules and rewards in game.": "第一次开放时间配置为第三周，星期四，服务器时间 12:00。该窗口持续一小时，每 7 天重复一次。它与领地游戏同时进行。为这次跨州比赛计划单独的集会和增援名单，并在游戏中验证活动条目、捕获规则和奖励。",
  "The two strongest alliances in a state enter roster lock first in the client rules. Players in a locked alliance cannot join or leave it during the lock. The client also says alliances created after matchmaking cannot enter the season map. Confirm eligibility and finish roster changes before your state’s lock.": "在客户规则中，一个州内两个最强的联盟首先进入名单锁定。锁定联盟的玩家在锁定期间不能加入或离开联盟。客户还表示，匹配后创建的联盟无法进入赛季地图。在您所在州锁定之前确认资格并完成名册变更。",
  "The v474 research did not establish a launch date, final matchmaking groups, State 415’s opponents, or camp assignments. Historical state brackets are useful background. Use live matchmaking and server announcements to plan against specific opponents.": "v474 研究没有确定启动日期、最终配对组、415 州的对手或营地分配。历史状态括号是有用的背景。使用实时配对和服务器公告来针对特定对手制定计划。",
  "This browser could not save the roster. Keep the page open to retain your edits.": "该浏览器无法保存名单。保持页面打开以保留您的编辑。",
